        <body>
            <div xml:id="d46">

                <pb facs="0161" n="65" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg65"/>

                <head>No. 44.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Jones to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Brussels</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1874-07-07"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 7, 1874</date>.
                        (Rec’d July 20.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 273.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to transmit herewith copy
                    of Count d’ Aspremont Lynden’s letter in regard to the termination of the treaty
                    between the United States and Belgium of July, 1858.</p>
                <p>Very respectfully, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>J. R. JONES.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d46-a1.xml" xpointer="d46-a1"/>
